                "text": "I\u2019m leading a bill to ensure our service members and federal employees get the pay they have missed so far due to the shutdown. People need to pay their bills now. Simple as that.\n\nI encourage my colleagues to get behind it as we work to address the health care crisis and end this shutdown. Read more: https://t.co/DQJ055dgQF",
