                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Hey Michigan\u00a0\ud83d\udc4b\u00a0if you get your health insurance from https://t.co/LzN7ScNgoR, you can now visit that site to see how\u00a0much\u00a0health care plans will cost next year. Michigan\u2019s open enrollment period for health care starts this Saturday, Nov. 1, but you can start\u00a0comparing rates\u00a0today.",
