                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "I\u2019ve unfortunately heard from thousands of Michiganders who are concerned, or have already heard from their insurance providers, that their health care premiums will skyrocket next year.\n\nIf this is you, please don\u2019t hesitate to reach out to my office\u00a0to share your story. I will always fight to ensure Michiganders and their families have access to quality, affordable health care.\nhttps://t.co/hREqFF7eYP",
