                "text": "Health care is a fundamental right. I\u00a0stand\u00a0ready\u00a0to come to the table with\u00a0my\u00a0Republican\u00a0colleagues\u00a0to ensure Americans have\u00a0access to\u00a0quality, affordable health care coverage\u00a0this year. https://t.co/C6ti6w946u",
