                "retweet_count": 8,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Here\u2019s the reality people are facing with health care plans. \n\nThanks to Republican\u2019s inaction, monthly bills are going\u00a0through the roof. That\u2019s why it is critical that we do not cut critical health care credits and exacerbate the rising health care costs caused by Republican\u2019s Big Ugly Bill.",
