                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 282,
                "retweet_count": 19,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "I wanted to share a message I received from\u00a0Stacy\u00a0in Marshall.\n\u00a0\nLike so many Americans right now, she is seeing\u00a0her\u00a0health care costs go up across the board\u00a0because of\u00a0Republicans\u2019\u00a0policies. Michiganders deserve better, more affordable health care. https://t.co/LTD9fvpUrw",
