                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 10223,
                "retweet_count": 1565,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "I am proposing a very simple deal to reopen the government:\n\n- Include a one-year clean extension of the current health care tax credits to immediately address Americans\u2019 rising costs.\n- Create a bipartisan committee that will continue negotiations on reforms ahead of next year\u2019s enrollment period\n\nCompromise is a two-way street. If Republicans want the votes, they need to work with us to address this health care crisis.",
