                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "It's a very simple compromise: Protect existing health care credits, end the shutdown.\n\u00a0\nWe must take action on rising costs for families who are shopping for their health care right now, and we can end this shutdown. https://t.co/PyNsuq0Tah",
