                "retweet_count": 131,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Republicans know health care costs are rising. Families are suffering right now. I\u2019m proposing a simple compromise. Extend the existing tax credits to provide some immediate relief, and we\u2019ll talk long-term solutions to lower health care costs after shutdown. https://t.co/mvrFkitpZd",
